+### Day 2 pre-session product feedback — Settings and model configuration — 2026-09-29
+
+This is real Owner feedback from inspecting the Settings UI, preserved before remediation. This technical inspection and Codex remediation **do not count as a Day 2 normal-user session**; the Owner-day count remains Day 1 / 7.
+
+Original Owner observations:
+
+```text
+1. Preferences are still effectively non-configurable.
+
+“If I cannot configure my preferences, how does the product know what Intelligence and Topics I care about?”
+
+2. Model settings are mostly read-only.
+
+The Owner expects local models to differ from machine to machine and wants local model discovery, system validation, and usable model configuration.
+
+3. For cloud Intelligence the Owner expects normal product configuration: select provider, select model, configure API key, and validate availability.
+
+4. “Deep Analysis” appears unfinished/unavailable. The Owner questions whether it should be presented as a current normal-user feature.
+```
