+- Root cause, fixes, validation, post-fix workspace counts, and Owner recheck: pending below. No Owner-day count is incremented.
+
+### Day 2 Settings/model remediation — Codex work — 2026-09-29
+
+This remediation and its automated checks are **not an Owner session**. The preserved feedback above was recorded before changes. Day 1 remains valid; Day 2 remains pending the Owner's manual verification and subsequent normal use.
+
+- **P1 engineering fixes:** Settings now separates Basic Preferences, Local AI, Cloud Intelligence, Backup, and read-only/system or deferred areas. Global focus/ignore preferences reuse the existing source-policy authority and feed future Intelligence selection; per-Following overrides remain available. Summaries remain faithful content-level outputs, and Topic association remains grounded in admitted Intelligence. No historical Intelligence or Topic was rewritten.
+- UI and default output language remain independently editable and persistent. Source language remains factual per-Content metadata, and original transcript/Evidence remains authoritative. The local-model panel discovers Ollama models, distinguishes discovered candidates from qualified/active models, and leaves qwen3:8b active. Cloud settings expose only the qualified Moonshot / kimi-k2.6 non-thinking, non-streaming route. API credentials use the backend credential-store abstraction; the UI never returns or persists a key. Saving a key does not authorize generation. Deep Analysis moved under later/advanced features.
+- Owner-approved forward migration **v029** added only model-configuration metadata. It stores no credential. Existing migration history was not changed. Production semantics remain qwen3:8b locally and Moonshot / kimi-k2.6 for explicitly consented cloud Intelligence; no model was activated or requalified.
+- The UI fixes also compacted the credential-deletion confirmation checkbox. Browser review at desktop and 768px found no horizontal overflow or clipped Settings controls. The visible sections distinguish editable settings, detected/qualified model status, read-only status, Backup, and deferred capabilities.
+- **Focused verification:** `uv run --frozen pytest tests/unit/test_model_configuration.py tests/unit/test_local_api.py tests/integration/test_state_store.py tests/unit/test_backup_restore.py` — **107 passed**. Ruff, mypy (62 files), compileall, frontend typecheck, Vitest (**80 passed**), and production build passed. `git diff --check` passed.
+- **Broad verification:** `uv run --frozen pytest` — **2512 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failed**. Playwright self-test on separate disposable workspaces passed for onboarding/sample isolation, all primary routes, Chinese/English UI, independent output-language persistence, Following copy and preference overrides, local discovery/candidate validation, fake in-memory credential save and non-generating connection test, Backup, and narrow layout. No browser console errors or cloud-confirm dispatch occurred. No real paid model generation was made.
+- **Bounded real-source smoke:** in a separate disposable workspace, Check Now ingested one public English Content item; canonical original-language transcript, local Scoring, and two original Evidence records were available. The same Content item used in the prior pre-Day-2 smoke again ended local Summary/Analysis with `FAILED_FINAL / INVALID_RESPONSE`; no Summary or Intelligence was fabricated. The Content page showed a truthful unavailable-Summary state and processing history with a Settings recovery hint; its Intelligence state remained “not processed.” The Source Run ended `NEEDS_ATTENTION / EXECUTION_CONDITION_UNRESOLVED` at Source Preparation. This repeated one-item output-validation failure remains a bounded P2; structured Summary paths pass unit/integration coverage. It did not touch the Owner workspace or dispatch cloud work.
+- **Credential and cloud truth:** the reloaded real M13 backend reports cloud credential source `NONE` and `credential_configured=false`; no key was displayed, copied, or changed. Automated connection checks used only the fake credential/probe adapter. Cloud generations: **0**; actual cost: **UNKNOWN** (no paid call was made; no ¥0 estimate is asserted).
+- **Real M13 workspace:** before startup, schema v028, **1 Following; 0** Source Runs, Content, Artifacts, Evidence, Intelligence, Topics, and resource-usage rows; `quick_check=ok`. After the authorized v029 migration, the same data counts remain and `quick_check=ok`. No fixture or test row was inserted into the Owner database. The real UI/API returned HTTP 200 at `http://127.0.0.1:5191/` / port 8791.
+- No P0 or unresolved core P1 remains in the Settings/model work. The bounded local Summary failure remains a P2. The seven-day window is unchanged because the fixes did not alter Evidence provenance, admission threshold, provider/model route, consent, exactly-once, or persistence authority. The Owner's 10-item manual Settings/model recheck remains pending; no Day 2 use is claimed. If the Owner's first next real session is on 2026-09-29, the earliest possible Day 7 becomes **2026-10-04**.
+
 ## Final reconciliation

